  "conclusion": "Over 20 years, $50K grows to $85,838 for the uninformed investor (BH SPY with panic selling) vs $189,039 for the optimal investor (K665 lookup table + Fear DCA) \u2014 a 2.20x wealth ratio. The Gini coefficient across 4 archetypes is 0.2818. Crucially, panic selling alone costs $275,928 (76.3% of potential). The biggest insight: the 3-row lookup table requires LESS financial literacy (3/5) than the continuous 12/VIX formula (4/5) while capturing 85.5% of VT performance. VT knowledge CAN be democratized \u2014 the real barrier is emotional discipline, not mathematical sophistication. The single highest-ROI intervention is anti-panic education.",
